nt Change Social Media? Meta TikTok minor protection regulatory settlement default settings age assurance COPPA age assurance algorithmic recommendations\" href=\"/podcast/en/p/2026-08-27-wsjournal-meta-180亿和解-买的是行业默认限制/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://megaphone.imgix.net/podcasts/b84f9932-8174-11e9-bbd8-7f261513f0c9/image/d84a4f4d55158df9d14f6f2d4b219a28.jpg?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&amp;max-w=3000&amp;max-h=3000&amp;fit=crop&amp;auto=format,compress&amp;w=400&amp;auto=format\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">22:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>Meta&#x27;s $18 Billion Settlement: Buying Industry-Wide Default Limits</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">The settlement amount is only the surface: what&#x27;s really valuable is the two-hour time lock, nighttime ban, and age assurance becoming default settings, plus the $18B-vs-$12B gap that pressures TikTok and YouTube to join.</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> Points</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> Quotes</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Meta</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\"\n data-hay=\"Before AI Spirals Out of Control, Plan A Is the Only Brake That Can Still Be Applied in Time Plan A uses &quot;research transparency + compute limits + citizen dividends&quot; to pull AI back from exponential explosion to a controllable slope; its author still rates it at a 15% catastrophe probability, but it beats sitting back and waiting for AI takeoff. 80,000 Hours Podcast 80,000 Hours AI 2027&#x27;s author returns with a plan to change the ending | Daniel Kokotajlo AI governance superintelligence AGI timeline Plan A alignment compute control Plan A horizon-length neuralese superpersuasion privacy-preserving auditing mutual assured compute destruction\" href